//! SQL Query Endpoint for JouleDB Server
//!
//! Provides HTTP and WebSocket endpoints for executing SQL queries
//! against the database.
//!
//! Supports:
//! - SELECT with WHERE, ORDER BY, LIMIT, GROUP BY, HAVING
//! - JOIN (INNER, LEFT, RIGHT, FULL, CROSS)
//! - Aggregate functions (COUNT, SUM, AVG, MIN, MAX)
//! - Subqueries (scalar, IN, EXISTS)
//! - INSERT INTO
//! - UPDATE with WHERE clause and expressions
//! - DELETE with WHERE clause
//! - CREATE TABLE / DROP TABLE
//! - BEGIN / COMMIT / ROLLBACK (transaction control)
//! - Parameter binding ($1, $2, etc.)

